WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.010
Today we will build and repeat a rhythmic pattern. Our work connects with selected

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:06.728
artists and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:12.670
Mark four beat spaces with dots on paper. Name a design choice that a selected

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:14.040
Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:14.867 --> 00:00:17.747
Choose claps and thigh taps to fill the beat spaces.

00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:21.747
Perform the pattern twice and check for a steady pulse.
